  (text "J1 = 20 gold pads (footprint already placed in PCB with nets).\n24C32 EEPROM on I2C at 0x50: vendor, product, version, overlay name (deckbusd reads it).\nTie MOD_DET# to GND on the module. 10 uF on +5V and VSYS near the pads, TVS on USB.\nNever back-feed VSYS/+5V/+3V3. Battery/solar modules output only on VCHG_IN (5-12 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 25.00 0)
